            "data": {
                "cereal_class_version": 0,
                "value0": {
                    "cereal_class_version": 0,
                    "value0": {
                        "cereal_class_version": 0
                    },
                    "contentPath_": "Assets\\Data\\NpcChatText/AirShipYoungMan.npcChat",
                    "guid_": {
                        "cereal_class_version": 0,
                        "value_": "656548D7-F173-449A-8028-D1A59A7F57D0"
                    }
                },
                "count": 7,
                "item_0": {
                    "cereal_class_version": 0,
                    "font_": {
                        "cereal_class_version": 0,
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483650,
                                "data": {
                                    "cereal_class_version": 0,
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "やあ、君もこの島は初めてかい？",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "cereal_class_version": 0,
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_1": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483651,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "見てごらん、島が雲の上に浮いてる。\n何度見ても不思議だよね。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_2": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483652,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "島の底には「島の心臓」が埋まってて、\nその力で浮いてるんだって。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_3": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483653,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "雲の下には昔、大地があったんだって。\n島はそこから持ち上げられたらしいよ。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_4": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483654,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "心臓が二つもある島は珍しいんだ。\nこの島は、ちょっと特別なんだよ。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_5": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483655,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "僕は空の果てまで旅するのが夢でね。\nこの船旅だけで、もう胸が躍ってるよ。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_6": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483656,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "ハンターになるなら、船を降りてすぐの\n教官に声をかけるといいよ。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}